# MLOps — YOLO + MLflow + APScheduler Rules

## MLflow
- Tracking URI: `sqlite:///mlruns.db` (local dev)
- 19 modèles enregistrés: voir `register_all_models_mlflow.py`
- UI: `python -m mlflow ui --backend-store-uri sqlite:///mlruns.db --port 5000`
- Experiments: SmartFarm_Animal_Detection | SmartFarm_Plant_Detection | SmartFarm_Alert_Detection | SmartFarm_Poultry_ML

## Enregistrer un nouveau modèle
```python
import mlflow
mlflow.set_tracking_uri("sqlite:///mlruns.db")
exp_id = mlflow.create_experiment("Mon_Experience")
with mlflow.start_run(experiment_id=exp_id, run_name="mon_run") as run:
    mlflow.log_param("epochs", 100)
    mlflow.log_metric("mAP50", 0.85)
    mlflow.log_artifact("path/to/best.pt", artifact_path="weights")
```

