## Drift Detection (PSI)
- Service: `backend/app/services/drift_detection_service.py`
- Seuils: PSI_WARNING=0.1, PSI_CRITICAL=0.2
- Vérification automatique toutes les 6h via APScheduler

## Auto-retraining
```python
# Dans backend/app/core/scheduler.py → check_drift_and_retrain()
# Déclenché quand PSI > PSI_CRITICAL
# Log via _trigger_retrain(farm_id) → à connecter à DVC pipeline
```

